h('1 Project Overview')
p('The root package is named hospitalcare-root and describes the product as HospitalCare - Integrated Hospital & Patient Management System. It is a multi-role web application for administrators, doctors, patients, and billing staff.')
p('The implemented problem scope is centralized handling of patient profiles, admissions and beds, appointments, clinical records and prescriptions, document storage, billing and insurance, secure role-based access, messaging, teleconsultation links, analytics, and audit logs.')
