h('3 Frontend Implementation')
p('Entry: frontend/src/main.tsx renders App. App wraps BrowserRouter with AuthProvider and uses ProtectedRoute plus role guards. /login and the landing page are public; /portal/* provides four role-specific route families.')
p('AuthContext stores token and safe user profile in localStorage keys hospitalcare_token and hospitalcare_user. It uses Firebase first if configured, otherwise calls backend login/signup routes. The Axios request interceptor attaches Authorization: Bearer <token>; the response interceptor clears local state and redirects on HTTP 401.')
