p('Forms submit API requests with Axios. Document forms use FormData and multipart/form-data. Download pages request blob responses, then create browser downloads. Client role routing improves UX, but backend role/ownership middleware is the authority.')

h('4 Backend Implementation')
p('Entry points: backend/src/server.ts initializes db then listens on configured port; backend/src/vercel.ts initializes once for serverless export; backend/api/index.js is the Vercel bridge. createApp() configures Helmet, CORS, Morgan outside tests, correlation/audit context, 10 MB JSON/urlencoded parsers, persistence middleware, global rate limit, health check, routers, 404 and centralized errors.')
p('Route modules authenticate first (except public auth operations), validate selected bodies with Zod, apply requireRoles and ownership checks, then call controller methods. Controllers return a consistent success/data/meta envelope; AppError and errorHandler return sanitized error code/message/requestId.')
