h('10 Project Architecture and Data Flow')
doc.add_paragraph('Browser UI\n  -> React 18 SPA: routes, AuthContext, Axios\n  -> /api (Vite dev proxy or Vercel rewrite)\n  -> Express: Helmet/CORS/context/persistence/rate limit\n  -> auth middleware + RBAC + ownership + Zod\n  -> controllers -> services -> in-memory HospitalDatabase\n  -> MongoDB collections OR local JSON snapshot\n  -> document bytes: local uploads OR Vercel Blob\n  -> optional Firebase Auth, configured Jitsi meeting host', style='Intense Quote')
p('Main operation example - document upload: user selects file -> page constructs FormData -> Axios sends bearer token -> Express authenticates and Multer buffers -> Zod validates fields -> service authorizes patient relation and checks size/type/signature -> storage writes bytes -> metadata is pushed into db.documents -> persistence middleware commits it -> API returns metadata.')
p('Admission example: admin submits patient/doctor/ward/room/bed/reason -> Zod + admin role -> admission service validates patient/doctor and bed availability -> BedService atomically marks Occupied and links the admission -> admission/current patient data updates -> persistence commits. Discharge creates summary and releases the linked bed.')

